      "topic_id": "geometric_vectors",
      "prompt": "OAB is a triangle with OA = \\vec{a} and OB = \\vec{b}. Point P lies on AB such that AP:PB = 4:1. Find the vector AP in terms of \\vec{a} and \\vec{b}, giving your answer in its simplest form.",
      "solution_steps": [
